course: dictionary
lesson: 3074
title: Words with more than one meaning
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and edgy is one of them. You can tell which meaning a writer means by reading the words around it. Those words are the context, and they give you clues.
explain: The first meaning is about a mood. Edgy means nervous, tense and easily annoyed. Before a big test, you might feel edgy and tap your pencil all the time. A character who snaps at others and jumps at every noise is edgy too.
explain: The second meaning is used in a different way. In art, music, fashion or comedy, edgy means bold, new and a bit shocking. A comedian with jokes that push the limits is being edgy. Look at the other words, like jokes, films or clothes, to know which meaning fits.
explain: In «all rough and edgy, like your shark-tooth saw», the clues are rough and shark-tooth saw. Those clues suggest a sharp, scratchy sound, like teeth. Try your meaning in the sentence to check that it still makes sense.
fact: Edgy is an adjective, so it describes a noun. Its forms are edgy, edgier and edgiest.
fact: Edgy meaning 1 means nervous, tense and easily annoyed.
fact: Edgy meaning 2 is informal and means bold, new and a bit shocking.
fact: The second meaning is often used about films, clothes, music and jokes.
fact: «The rrr-sound is all rough and edgy, like your shark-tooth saw» uses edgy to describe a sharp, rough sound, and the clues show this.
exercise: Maya feels edgy before her spelling test and keeps tapping her pencil. What does edgy mean here? | Pretty and calm | Bold, new and a bit shocking | *Nervous and tense | Tired after a long walk
exercise: The new film was edgy, with bold jokes that shocked some people. What does edgy mean here? | Nervous and easily annoyed | *Bold, new and a bit shocking | Sleepy and slow | Wet and grey
exercise: «The rrr-sound is all rough and edgy, like your shark-tooth saw.» What does edgy suggest about the sound? | Soft and smooth, like a pillow | Quiet and sleepy | *Sharp and rough, like teeth | Happy and bright
test: Dad says the band's new song is edgy. Which meaning fits best? | Nervous and easily annoyed | *Bold, new and a bit shocking | Sleepy and slow | Wet and grey
test: In a story, a character snaps at others and jumps at every noise. What does edgy describe? | Shiny and new | *Tense and easily annoyed | Calm and relaxed | Bold in art
exam: What clue in «all rough and edgy, like your shark-tooth saw» helps you work out the meaning of edgy? | The name Tegumai | The word draws | *The words rough and shark-tooth saw | The words sound-pictures and better
